<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet, with no sales slaughter steers or heifers confirmed. Inquiry and demand light.</p>
<p>For the week to date 125,700 head confirmed including 17,600 head or about 14 percent previously contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>Confirmed - none</p>
<p>	  (Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
